==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|cu|разбои}}, ultimately from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*orzbojь}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|разбо́й}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|разбо́й|adj=разбо́йный}}

# [[robbery]], [[brigandage]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[морско́й]] '''разбо́й'''|[[piracy]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''разбо́й''' [[на]] [[большо́й]] [[дорога|доро́ге]]|t=highway '''robbery'''}}
# {{lb|ru|law}} [[armed robbery]], [[aggravated]] [[robbery]] {{q|robbery with the threat or use of dangerous or deadly force}}
# {{lb|ru|billiards}} [[break]] [[shot]]

====Usage notes====
* In modern legal usage, {{m|ru|разбо́й}} is distinguished from {{m|ru|грабёж}} (robbery with the use of non-dangerous force).

